### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8005/health
Accept: application/json

### Create or reuse a payload
POST http://127.0.0.1:8005/payload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "list_1": ["first string", "second string", "third string"],
  "list_2": ["other string", "another string", "last string"]
}

### Read payload: replace UUID with the id returned above
GET http://127.0.0.1:8005/payload/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
